        "text": "Security update for python-python-dotenv",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for python-python-dotenv fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-28684: Prior to version 1.2.2, `set_key()` and `unset_key()` in python-dotenv follow symbolic links when\n  rewriting `.env` files, allowing a local attacker to overwrite arbitrary files via a crafted symlink (bsc#1262423).\n",
